t=\"346\" data-end=\"360\">Highlights</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"684\">\r\n<li data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"422\">\r\n<p data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"422\"><strong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"387\">Microchip-herkenning</strong>: opent alleen voor jouw kat(ten)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"478\">\r\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"478\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"447\">Selectieve toegang</strong>: houdt vreemde katten buiten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"540\">\r\n<p data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"540\">Werkt ook met <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"510\">RFID-hanger</strong> (voor niet-gechipte dieren)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"574\"><strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"572\">Opslag tot ~32 huisdieren</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"633\"><strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"601\">Batterijvoeding (AA)</strong> met <strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"631\">low-battery indicatie</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"684\"><strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"664\">Handmatige vergrendeling</strong> (4-standensluiting)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"710\">Specificaties (kort)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<li data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"763\">\r\n<p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"763\"><strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"722\">Type:</strong> SureFlap Microchip kattenluik (maat M)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"782\">\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"782\"><strong data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"776\">Kleur:</strong> Wit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"825\"><strong data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"808\">Afmetingen (circa):</strong> 28 × 7 × 26 cm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<l